{"id":"n56520-1-7","stage":3,"title":"바래다주다 · 送","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56520-1-7-1","ko":"택시 타고 왔니? 버스는 끊겼을 텐데.","zh":"你是坐出租车来的吗？公交车应该已经停运了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"택시","meaning":"出租车","explanation":"택시：出租车","readings":[{"term":"택시","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18772","senseId":"1","lemma":"택시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"택시","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3"}},{"text":"타고","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타고","audio":"/audio/8aebcd33801f792f7638.mp3"}},{"text":"왔니?","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔니","audio":"/audio/fcfe3eb77392c7ddf554.mp3"}},{"text":"버스는","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스는","audio":"/audio/f9aebeae5f9df06cdc55.mp3"}},{"text":"끊겼을","meaning":"停运","explanation":"끊기다：停运；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"끊기다","audio":"/audio/1c17513212c92636598a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14657","senseId":"11","lemma":"끊기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끊겼을","audio":"/audio/6c87d7710c7f1ed592c8.mp3"}},{"text":"텐데.","meaning":"表示打算、推测或意志。","explanation":"터：表示打算、推测或意志。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"터","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72183","senseId":"1","lemma":"터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"텐데","audio":"/audio/90a58f56d3a14e3432dc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"94be61a73763ee4c","term":"택시","zh":"出租车","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3","entryId":"18772","definition":"收费后，将客人送到其指定地点的汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1c17513212c92636","term":"끊기다","zh":"停运","audio":"/audio/1c17513212c92636598a.mp3","entryId":"14657","definition":"曾经持续的运行不再继续。","pronunciation":["끈키다"]},{"id":"cfabc7b0ff6f800c","term":"터","zh":"表示打算、推测或意志。","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3","entryId":"72183","definition":"表示打算、推测或意志。","pronunciation":["터"]}],"audio":"/audio/5e16166dea3555ae3d95.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56520-1-7-2","ko":"아니요. 친구가 차로 바래다줬어요.","zh":"不是的，是朋友开车送我来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"친구가","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구가","audio":"/audio/61bf5bfb043d2161ceed.mp3"}},{"text":"차로","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차로","audio":"/audio/2d655b3c60e6896e2dcd.mp3"}},{"text":"바래다줬어요.","meaning":"送，送到","explanation":"바래다주다：送，送到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"바래다주다","audio":"/audio/c62dda77a41682861fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56520","senseId":"1","lemma":"바래다주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바래다줬어요","audio":"/audio/bd6b67ea6487a52d1675.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"c62dda77a4168286","term":"바래다주다","zh":"送，送到","audio":"/audio/c62dda77a41682861fae.mp3","entryId":"56520","definition":"将离去的人送至一定的地方。","pronunciation":["바래다주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e505cf7f87a8b85005f8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56520","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":106,"sequenceScore":2.7667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你是坐出租车来的吗？公交车应该已经停运了吧。","不是的，是朋友开车送我来的。","这次要不要试着学学游泳？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你是坐出租车来的吗？公交车应该已经停运了吧。","不是的，是朋友开车送我来的。","这次要不要试着学学游泳？"],"answer":1}]}
